# Line endings are LF in the repository AND in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# Why this file exists: the app repository vendors this site's legal extract as its record of
# what is published, and a case in that repository compares the two copies. Without this file a
# Windows checkout here lands CRLF while the app's checkout is LF, so the two files differ on
# every line while saying exactly the same thing. That is a diff nobody can act on, and it hid a
# real failure once: the extract had gone stale while this repository advanced, and the
# comparison was red for that reason and for the line endings at the same time.
#
# These are static pages served as-is, so LF everywhere is also simply what is served.
* text=auto eol=lf
